#: ../../source/docs/common-imu-fft-test-flight.rst:7
#: 1654727117e74f1b898a622f7a116fe7 6a15fb4c807b466fb5e46b775477901e
#: db1a5c1da29a4b579641af2249cc2583
msgid "Initial Flight and Post-Flight Analysis"
msgstr "初始 FFT 测试飞行"

#: ../../source/docs/common-imu-fft-test-flight.rst:9
#: 37e1615042e147a08ac2b4245b69f679 ab3d8b9bac4f4b36a160b4b00fba5369
#: eabfe255286f45bd862bb00934fba4f3
msgid ""
"Perform a hover flight of at least 30s in altitude hold and :ref:`download "
"the dataflash logs <common-downloading-and-analyzing-data-logs-in-mission-"
"planner>` without the harmonic notch being enabled."
msgstr ""
"在定高模式下悬停飞行至少 30 秒，并在未启用谐波陷波的情况下 :ref:`下载 dataflash 日志 <common-downloading-"
"and-analyzing-data-logs-in-mission-planner>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-imu-fft-test-flight.rst:10
#: 01cc096cecef4f1ba2b90d0d218ba3a0 47b6f713da1e4674bf66a1aff89cf058
#: beef032dd27f4eff9c9edaac51046e2f
msgid ""
"Graph the log element FTN1.PkAvg which represents the FFT's energy-weighted "
"estimate of the average noise frequency for roll and pitch."
msgstr "将 ``FFT_ENABLE`` 设置为 1，但暂不启用谐波陷波滤波器（保持 ``INS_HNTCH_ENABLE`` = 0）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-imu-fft-test-flight.rst:12
#: 19df3009f31f4f30a9bc9e665a085a24 23fee9e8a3aa44459262b17aec3f1036
#: e765156353884a318a451f396546ec45
msgid ""
"On the graph there should be a fairly consistent estimate of the noise peak "
"that corresponds to the motor rotational frequency. On a smaller Copter this"
" is likely to be around 200Hz and on a larger Copter/QuadPlane 100Hz or so. "
"Here is an example from a 5\" quad running on a Pixracer. Once the pilot has"
" throttled up there is a fairly consistent noise level at about 220Hz:"
msgstr ""
"图上应能看到与电机旋转频率对应的、相当稳定的噪声峰估计。小型多旋翼上通常在 200Hz 左右，较大的多旋翼/QuadPlane 上约 "
"100Hz。下面是一台跑 Pixracer 的 5 寸四轴的示例：飞手推油门后，在约 220Hz 处有相当稳定的噪声电平："

#: ../../source/docs/common-imu-fft-test-flight.rst:18
#: 0123b343eace4e748946d85182955b86 86e3b98f63074b88956b586c496ddef2
#: e8dd6b00c08542da8e03ef40d6a4273c
msgid ""
"If a consistent estimate is obtained, you can then enable the harmonic "
"notch, as described in :ref:`common-imu-fft`."
msgstr "如果得到了稳定一致的估计值，就可以按 :ref:`common-imu-fft` 所述启用谐波陷波。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-imu-fft-test-flight.rst:20
#: 0eafa65ec682455eb73059e3393a9689 2e6ce4decc9b45ffb7f47e87a6afe1a7
#: 4e1b9a63dfc34f43838436d1edd455cf
msgid ""
"In this flight the dynamic harmonic notch was enabled and set to track the "
"FFT determined frequency and FFT analysis of the post-filter log shows that "
"the gyro noise has been effectively eliminated:"
msgstr ""
"如果 ``FTN.PkAvg`` 显示的主峰值频率稳定且合理（通常在 50–400 Hz 之间），则可以进行下一步，启用基于 FFT 的谐波陷波。"
